    "https://nec.peopleadmin.com/postings/7493": {
      "title": "Adjunct Faculty - Biology",
      "description": "New England College Applicant Portal | Adjunct Faculty - Biology Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Benefit Highlights Internal Recruitment Center To see available work study & graduate assistant jobs, use the “Current NEC Employees and Students Log In” then click “search student jobs” Adjunct Faculty - Biology Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Please include the names and contact information for 3 references in the CV. Posting Details Position Information Job Title Adjunct Faculty - Biology Position Purpose New England College seeks a part-time faculty member to teach a variety of in-person courses in the undergraduate Biology, Biochemistry, Health Science, and Health Studies programs on our Henniker, NH campus. Instructor needs include, but are not limited to, Human Biology, Human Anatomy & Physiology, and Microbiology. Essential Duties Summary • Engage all students to facilitate and achieve course learning outcomes • Review and grade all work submitted by students and provide timely and substantive feedback • Coach struggling students toward success • Provide “experiential learning” opportunities whenever possible Required Qualifications • Minimum of a Master’s degree in related subject area • Prior teaching and proven record of teaching effectiveness Preferred Qualifications • Ph.D. in related field preferred EEO Statement New England College prohibits discrimination on the basis of race, color, creed or religion, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, age, marital status, pregnancy, veteran’s status or disability in regard to treatment, access to or employment in its programs and activities, in accordance with federal and state laws and regulations. In compliance with the Americans with Disabilities Act ( ADA ), individuals with disabilities needing accommodation should contact the ADA Compliance Officer. Posting Detail Information Posting Number PT00133P Open Date Close Date Open Until Filled No Starting Salary $850 per credit Special Instructions to Applicants Please include the names and contact information for 3 references in the CV. Reference Requests Reference Requests Minimum Requests Maximum Requests Cutoff Date Provider Special Instructions Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Do you live in CA, CO, or WA? Yes No Documents Needed To Apply Required Documents Resume/CV Cover Letter Optional Documents Henniker Campus 98 Bridge Street Henniker, NH 03242 603.428.2000 Contact Us: hr@nec.edu | 603-428-2359 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
